# Zue — Design (rule)

- Tipografia: **Playfair Display** + **Inter** light; paleta P/B/cinza; `rounded-none`.
- Sem scrollbar visível; `user-select: none` (exceto inputs).
- Tablet: safe-area, alvos ≥44px, `:active`, `landscape` / `short-landscape`.
- Preferir `src/components/ui/`; respeitar `prefers-reduced-motion`.

**Detalhes:** skill **zue-design**.
